close_reason: "Duplicate GitHub #278 provenance removed on this branch: pm-web-cnhi no longer carries the tag, and links the cited-evidence feature (the sole owner) as related. Before: scheduled sync run 41407648593 refused with a duplicate provenance tag. After: the same gated dry-run (pm-github 2026.10.19) passes against this tracker with import 6, update 4, skip 0. The merged result is re-checked by dispatching the scheduled sync after merge."
